      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JET BOOTS TOMMY (1) scored (30.09) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Form at the trip sound including seven wins. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Hard to go past. ZIPPING KRISTOFF (3) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 29.67 with a 3.5 lengths win at this track over 515m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ZIPPING HOPKINS (8) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close third, 2 lengths from the winner Impress Spieth (20.76) at Nowra. Hard to beat again. BOTH BOWERS ACE (7) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
